        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ramat_Gan"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Ramat Gan’s national stadium seats 50,000, making it the country’s premier athletic venue.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
